<p>Child of <ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title="Architecture Overview" ri:version-at-save="1" /><ac:link-body>Architecture Overview</ac:link-body></ac:link>. One schema per tenant, shared identity tables in <code>public</code>.</p><h2>Tables</h2><table data-layout="default" data-table-display-mode="fixed"><colgroup><col style="width: 160.0px;" /><col style="width: 320.0px;" /><col style="width: 120.0px;" /></colgroup><tbody><tr><th><p>Table</p></th><th><p>Purpose</p></th><th><p>Rows</p></th></tr><tr><td><p><code>users</code></p></td><td><p>Identity</p></td><td><p>12,450</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><code>projects</code></p></td><td><p>Per-tenant work containers</p><ul><li><p>A list inside a cell</p></li></ul></td><td><p>830</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Schema</h2><ac:structured-macro ac:name="code" ac:schema-version="1" ac:macro-id="28545c30-8548-4156-80bd-2b179c462197"><ac:parameter ac:name="language">sql</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[CREATE TABLE projects (
